# Reference: existing DSH Web headless runtime (homelinux2, informational).
# deploy-remote.sh does NOT touch this unit; it only installs the dshssh
# exec-server unit. This file documents how the DSH Web runtime is launched so
# new targets can reproduce it.
#
# Install: ~/.config/systemd/user/dsh-rsi.service
[Unit]
Description=DeepSeek Harness RSI Web with official Codex subagent
Wants=network-online.target mihomo-dsh.service
After=network-online.target mihomo-dsh.service

[Service]
Type=simple
WorkingDirectory=/home/USER
Environment=DSH_HOME=/home/USER/.local/share/dsh-rsi/home
Environment=DSH_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
Environment=PATH=/home/USER/.local/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
ExecStart=/home/USER/.local/bin/node /home/USER/.local/share/dsh-rsi/runtime/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/lib/bin.js web --host 127.0.0.1 --port 3081
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5
UMask=0077

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
